cat > prompts.json << 'EOF'
{
  "feature": "protein-macro-floor",
  "branch": "fix/protein-macro-floor",
  "prompts": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "description": "Raise protein multipliers (lose-fat all diets, gain-muscle+keto) and lift min clamp from 1.2 to 1.6 g/kg LBM in lib/nutrition.ts",
      "prompt": "Edit only the file lib/nutrition.ts. Make exactly two changes, both numeric-literal updates — do NOT change any function signature, export, parameter, or surrounding control flow. Change 1: inside `proteinGPerKgLbm(goal, dietType)`, update the `lose-fat` branch and the `gain-muscle` + `keto` sub-branch only. The new return values must be: for goal === \"lose-fat\" — `high-protein` → 2.2, `keto` → 1.8, `balanced` or `intermittent-fasting` → 1.8, default (no matching dietType) → 1.8. For goal === \"gain-muscle\" — `keto` → 1.8. Leave all other branches in `proteinGPerKgLbm` untouched (gain-muscle high-protein stays 2.2, gain-muscle balanced/IF/default stays 1.8, recomposition high-protein stays 2.0, recomposition default stays 1.8, final fallback stays 1.8). Change 2: inside `calculateNutritionTargets()`, replace the literal `1.2` in `const minProteinG = Math.round(lbmForFormula * 1.2)` with `1.6`. Leave the `2.2` max clamp on the very next line unchanged. Do NOT edit any other file — specifically NOT lib/meal-store.ts (do NOT bump PROFILE_VERSION), NOT any app/api/* route, NOT components/*. Verify: `npm run build` passes with zero TS errors; the only diff is in lib/nutrition.ts and consists solely of numeric-literal changes."
    }
  ]
